# PDP 50/50 Theme Editor controls (HARD)

**Locked 2026-09-10** after Coperni mobile QA. Applies to **all** PDP fifty-fifty sections.

**Skill:** `.cursor/skills/barreletics-pdp-fifty-fifty-te-controls/SKILL.md` (if present)  
**OS:** `planning/fifty-fifty-pdp-mobile-LOCKED.md`

## Global rendered lock

| What | Value |
|---|---|
| Phone text pad | **96 / 96** |
| Phone photo (lifestyle COVER) | **550** |
| Desktop min height | **560** |
| Desktop text pad | **80** typical (`vertical_padding`) |
| Side pad | **64** |
| Panel bg | **`#faf8f6`** |

Text pads are **identical on every 50/50**. Never special-case Grip (or any one block).

## Packshot FIT exception (media axis only)

Square / packshot photos (e.g. purple shoe):

- `fit` + `media_bg` = panel cream
- Phone frame **~400** so the shoe fills the box (no tall cream letterbox under the shoe)
- That letterbox is **not** text pad — do not raise/lower 96/96 to fix it

Lifestyle: **COVER** + **550**.

## Working TE / JSON keys

- Text pad top/bottom — phone (**96** unless Andrew names an exception)
- Media fit / Media fit — phone
- Image scale (**100** default)
- Focal custom X/Y when needed
- Desktop `vertical_padding` / `side_padding` / `section_gap`

## How to finish PDP QC

1. All 50/50 text pads = **96/96** on that template.
2. Lifestyle media = **550** COVER; packshot FIT = **~400** frame.
3. One axis per push. No pad thrash to fix media.

```
❌ Special-case Grip text pads
❌ “Fix” FIT cream letterbox by changing text pad
❌ Hardcode product text pad to 104
✅ 96/96 everywhere + packshot frame ~400 FIT
```
